  "title": "Never Fail Applesauce Spice Cake",
  "description": "This never-fail applesauce spice cake recipe uses just two bowls and one pan for a very moist, warmly spiced cake with walnuts and pecans for crunch.",
  "authors": [
    "Glenda"
  ],
